# xcodebuild run from inside macos/ resolves the framework's output path
# relative to that directory and writes macos/macos/GhosttyKit.xcframework —
# three quarters of a gigabyte of build output beside the source it was built
# from. Ignored rather than remembered: it was committed once, by a `git add
# -A` that had no way to tell it apart from the code beside it, and GitHub
# refuses a push carrying a 377 MB file.
macos/macos/
